# nodes: renders the kdevops node-list file consumed by the
# provisioner backends (guestfs/libvirt, terraform/cloud, nixos).
# The active backend selects the template via the Make variable
# KDEVOPS_NODES_TEMPLATE (set by scripts/guestfs.Makefile,
# scripts/terraform.Makefile, scripts/nixos.Makefile). The output
# path lives in KDEVOPS_NODES, set by the workflow.
